(5761016, 838058, 108580, '<td valign="top">Ducks don''t give a damn :) Image looks 1st world war-ish. Lots of grain but pleasing. Framing of the towers by the bridge shows attention to composition. WD.</td>', 'Ducks don''t give a damn :) Image looks 1st world war-ish. Lots of grain but pleasing. Framing of the towers by the bridge shows attention to composition. WD.', '2009-12-09 05:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
