(5761071, 837407, 103032, '<td valign="top">Only critique is that the horizon is tilted.  Otherwise, a great pic for the challenge.  For me, there''s a nice rhythm to the pic where the seagulls closer to the light are smaller and as you get farther from the light, the gulls are darker and more prominent.</td>', 'Only critique is that the horizon is tilted.  Otherwise, a great pic for the challenge.  For me, there''s a nice rhythm to the pic where the seagulls closer to the light are smaller and as you get farther from the light, the gulls are darker and more prominent.', '2009-12-09 06:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5761078, 838478, 103032, '<td valign="top">Definitely meets the challenge.  I like the B&amp;W conversion.  Like the eye contact, well done portrait.</td>', 'Definitely meets the challenge.  I like the B&W conversion.  Like the eye contact, well done portrait.', '2009-12-09 06:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
