(5761184, 838247, 30049, '<td valign="top">Winner!  Well, at least so far.  Still have 73 more to look at.  :-)  Nice shot.  You must have been crazy with excitement seeing this unfold before you!  Right place, right time, great capture.</td>', 'Winner!  Well, at least so far.  Still have 73 more to look at.  :-)  Nice shot.  You must have been crazy with excitement seeing this unfold before you!  Right place, right time, great capture.', '2009-12-09 08:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5761206, 838477, 49788, '<td valign="top">Really nice color in the sky. Photo is a bit noisy and could be sharper, and the foreground is a bit dark.</td>', 'Really nice color in the sky. Photo is a bit noisy and could be sharper, and the foreground is a bit dark.', '2009-12-09 09:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5761211, 838053, 49788, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro shot. Great color and detail. Nicely cropped.</td>', 'Very nice macro shot. Great color and detail. Nicely cropped.', '2009-12-09 09:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5761214, 838405, 49788, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, but I think the image could benefit from a different composition. The centered horse makes the image feel a bit static, and rather than framing the horse, the branches creep into it.</td>', 'Neat idea, but I think the image could benefit from a different composition. The centered horse makes the image feel a bit static, and rather than framing the horse, the branches creep into it.', '2009-12-09 09:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5761215, 838163, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the result, am interested in the set up, and spent some time looking at your photo.  Pity it is in this challenge though because I think it is not very fitting to the subject.</td>', 'I like the result, am interested in the set up, and spent some time looking at your photo.  Pity it is in this challenge though because I think it is not very fitting to the subject.', '2009-12-09 09:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5761219, 837741, 49788, '<td valign="top">A really nice shot. Very grim feeling, with the low, cold sun, and the graffitied tanks. The lens flare actually enhances the image. I might have cropped less tightly in the upper right so you get the whole tank, but you may have not had that option. Again, overall, I really like it.</td>', 'A really nice shot. Very grim feeling, with the low, cold sun, and the graffitied tanks. The lens flare actually enhances the image. I might have cropped less tightly in the upper right so you get the whole tank, but you may have not had that option. Again, overall, I really like it.', '2009-12-09 09:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5761224, 838369, 49788, '<td valign="top">Neat! No idea what this is, but I like it. Really nicely cropped and good definition on the hands. I love how some of the lasers (?) pass in front of the arms, and some behind.</td>', 'Neat! No idea what this is, but I like it. Really nicely cropped and good definition on the hands. I love how some of the lasers (?) pass in front of the arms, and some behind.', '2009-12-09 09:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5761226, 838104, 51538, '<td valign="top">That frame is ugly and detracts from the photo.  Your photo should stand without the need of crutches like this frame to support it. 3.  PS, came back to add, please excuse my grumpy comment!  And that yours is not the only photo that takes (IMO) liberties with the frame.  Otherwise, I tend to like the subject.</td>', 'That frame is ugly and detracts from the photo.  Your photo should stand without the need of crutches like this frame to support it. 3.  PS, came back to add, please excuse my grumpy comment!  And that yours is not the only photo that takes (IMO) liberties with the frame.  Otherwise, I tend to like the subject.', '2009-12-09 09:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5761228, 838334, 49788, '<td valign="top">Oustanding sky and neat reflection in the water.</td>', 'Oustanding sky and neat reflection in the water.', '2009-12-09 09:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5761229, 838399, 49788, '<td valign="top">I love how the way you lit this makes the rose look like it''s made of glass. Really great effect.</td>', 'I love how the way you lit this makes the rose look like it''s made of glass. Really great effect.', '2009-12-09 09:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5761232, 837508, 49788, '<td valign="top">This is a really wonderful portrait -- love the detail, tones, lighting, the variety of color, and Francis''s position (turned foot) -- but it doesn''t use the technique. The lighting is clearly behind the camera, not the subject.</td>', 'This is a really wonderful portrait -- love the detail, tones, lighting, the variety of color, and Francis''s position (turned foot) -- but it doesn''t use the technique. The lighting is clearly behind the camera, not the subject.', '2009-12-09 09:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5761237, 837453, 49788, '<td valign="top">Nice. If it were advanced editing, killing the branch in the upper left would have made it even better.</td>', 'Nice. If it were advanced editing, killing the branch in the upper left would have made it even better.', '2009-12-09 09:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
