(5764009, 838170, 110041, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene and colours.</td>', 'Lovely scene and colours.', '2009-12-11 13:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764010, 837539, 110041, '<td valign="top">Tilt works especially well here as does the sepia.</td>', 'Tilt works especially well here as does the sepia.', '2009-12-11 13:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764012, 837869, 110041, '<td valign="top">Good mood and lighting. Silly hat. :p</td>', 'Good mood and lighting. Silly hat. :p', '2009-12-11 13:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764021, 838143, 110041, '<td valign="top">Not for me this one. Not many endearing features of the shot.<br/> <br/>Does meet the challenge.</td>', 'Not for me this one. Not many endearing features of the shot. Does meet the challenge.', '2009-12-11 13:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764022, 838398, 110041, '<td valign="top">Minimalistic and simple. Grainy look works ok and is helped by the out of focus blade of grass.</td>', 'Minimalistic and simple. Grainy look works ok and is helped by the out of focus blade of grass.', '2009-12-11 13:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764245, 837653, 554, '<td valign="top">I think you have tried to fool us with your light source.</td>', 'I think you have tried to fool us with your light source.', '2009-12-11 19:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764255, 838398, 83845, '<td valign="top">I really like the texture that the noise makes here.  I think that cropping the bottom at the distracting horizontal line would greatly improve your score,  IMO.  When I scroll the photo down to where I can''t see this line, it seems to not only take away the distraction, but it improves the composition.</td>', 'I really like the texture that the noise makes here.  I think that cropping the bottom at the distracting horizontal line would greatly improve your score,  IMO.  When I scroll the photo down to where I can''t see this line, it seems to not only take away the distraction, but it improves the composition.', '2009-12-11 20:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764258, 837839, 83845, '<td valign="top">Love it!  The shadows are great.  Perfect for the challenge!</td>', 'Love it!  The shadows are great.  Perfect for the challenge!', '2009-12-11 20:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764259, 838258, 83845, '<td valign="top">Challenge-wise it may not score great, but I love the colors and the warmth.</td>', 'Challenge-wise it may not score great, but I love the colors and the warmth.', '2009-12-11 20:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764272, 838042, 83845, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent photo on so many levels!... and not just because this dog looks like mine.  lol  It meets the challenge, takes advantage of the light, has great lines and patters, and great depth!</td>', 'This is an excellent photo on so many levels!... and not just because this dog looks like mine.  lol  It meets the challenge, takes advantage of the light, has great lines and patters, and great depth!', '2009-12-11 20:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764274, 838477, 111808, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky tones behind the full tree silhouette, multiple colours blended together make this a visual delight.</td>', 'Beautiful sky tones behind the full tree silhouette, multiple colours blended together make this a visual delight.', '2009-12-11 20:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764281, 838257, 83845, '<td valign="top">The sky and the skyline look incredible, but IMO the bottom half of the photo is lacking sharpness in the lighted part and loses interest below that.</td>', 'The sky and the skyline look incredible, but IMO the bottom half of the photo is lacking sharpness in the lighted part and loses interest below that.', '2009-12-11 20:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764289, 838017, 110186, '<td valign="top">I like it. What''s the purple/rainbow strip by the dog? Refraction of light?</td>', 'I like it. What''s the purple/rainbow strip by the dog? Refraction of light?', '2009-12-11 20:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764291, 838050, 111808, '<td valign="top">The view that the occupants of that far off hot air balloon get to see high above must be spectacular and beautiful. Your photograph certainly is. The fog draws the eye first inward to the balloon then on to the life giving sun and cloud dancing patterns. Great shot.</td>', 'The view that the occupants of that far off hot air balloon get to see high above must be spectacular and beautiful. Your photograph certainly is. The fog draws the eye first inward to the balloon then on to the life giving sun and cloud dancing patterns. Great shot.', '2009-12-11 20:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764294, 838345, 83845, '<td valign="top">An amazing photo!!  Top 3 in my book.</td>', 'An amazing photo!!  Top 3 in my book.', '2009-12-11 20:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764297, 838451, 83845, '<td valign="top">Blue ribbon if I had my way.</td>', 'Blue ribbon if I had my way.', '2009-12-11 20:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764298, 837539, 111808, '<td valign="top">There is a great amount of creative control in this that is not, perhaps, readily apparent at first view. The diagonal perspective is odd and the dark watcher lends a bit of an eerie touch to the horses which are spinning round so fast they are almost, but not quite, invisible except for the ghosting movement blur. Yet the centre lights are perfectly in focus and sharp where desired. The more I study it, the more in resonates.</td>', 'There is a great amount of creative control in this that is not, perhaps, readily apparent at first view. The diagonal perspective is odd and the dark watcher lends a bit of an eerie touch to the horses which are spinning round so fast they are almost, but not quite, invisible except for the ghosting movement blur. Yet the centre lights are perfectly in focus and sharp where desired. The more I study it, the more in resonates.', '2009-12-11 20:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764301, 838206, 83845, '<td valign="top">It won''t let me stop looking at it until I give it a 10.</td>', 'It won''t let me stop looking at it until I give it a 10.', '2009-12-11 21:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764303, 838490, 83845, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous photo!</td>', 'A gorgeous photo!', '2009-12-11 21:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764306, 837714, 111808, '<td valign="top">The light coming in from the right side of this seascape is very beautiful and bathes the scene in a warm glow. The waves are soft, flowing, peaceful. An undine elemental as this scene is pure Magick.</td>', 'The light coming in from the right side of this seascape is very beautiful and bathes the scene in a warm glow. The waves are soft, flowing, peaceful. An undine elemental as this scene is pure Magick.', '2009-12-11 21:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764308, 838176, 83845, '<td valign="top">It''s a great sunset/rise.  My suggestion is to get closer and/or more importantly a different angle.  Getting down low makes the biggest difference sometimes.</td>', 'It''s a great sunset/rise.  My suggestion is to get closer and/or more importantly a different angle.  Getting down low makes the biggest difference sometimes.', '2009-12-11 21:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764310, 838451, 111808, '<td valign="top">The delicate silhouette is beautiful in its innate simplicity.</td>', 'The delicate silhouette is beautiful in its innate simplicity.', '2009-12-11 21:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764313, 838510, 83845, '<td valign="top">It''s very small, but has potential.</td>', 'It''s very small, but has potential.', '2009-12-11 21:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764318, 837935, 83845, '<td valign="top">There it is... the blue!</td>', 'There it is... the blue!', '2009-12-11 21:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764323, 838049, 111808, '<td valign="top">I love the all the little rills which down their channels fret in this and the colours are beautiful, the pure pristine white of the waterfall contrasting with the autumn reddish browns. There is just a hint of a low sun in the middle which balances the composition and lights the gold of the spinning flow. Very rich composition, very well captured.</td>', 'I love the all the little rills which down their channels fret in this and the colours are beautiful, the pure pristine white of the waterfall contrasting with the autumn reddish browns. There is just a hint of a low sun in the middle which balances the composition and lights the gold of the spinning flow. Very rich composition, very well captured.', '2009-12-11 21:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764326, 838229, 111808, '<td valign="top">Vibrant rich life colours kissing the darkness of the mountain, awesome juxtaposition, great capture.</td>', 'Vibrant rich life colours kissing the darkness of the mountain, awesome juxtaposition, great capture.', '2009-12-11 21:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764335, 838494, 111808, '<td valign="top">This is peaceful, even the little tidepools are reflecting the clouds lit by the sunstar and the incoming waves are edgelit so that they sparkle like gold. The cloud shapes are echoing the rock formations, jagged, uneven, forming a spit of land holding fast against the sea. Superbly done.</td>', 'This is peaceful, even the little tidepools are reflecting the clouds lit by the sunstar and the incoming waves are edgelit so that they sparkle like gold. The cloud shapes are echoing the rock formations, jagged, uneven, forming a spit of land holding fast against the sea. Superbly done.', '2009-12-11 21:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764344, 837748, 111808, '<td valign="top">Emerald turquoise water with a gentle tide coming in on a peaceful sandy beach cove highlighted by the lapping of the wavelets. The two tone brown gold patterns are a nice warm touch, and the shadows and silhouette of the enclasping rocks is enhanced further by the blown but even-white sky, which echoes the salt spray mist and provides a clear colour delineating contrast. I''d like to be here watching the ocean.</td>', 'Emerald turquoise water with a gentle tide coming in on a peaceful sandy beach cove highlighted by the lapping of the wavelets. The two tone brown gold patterns are a nice warm touch, and the shadows and silhouette of the enclasping rocks is enhanced further by the blown but even-white sky, which echoes the salt spray mist and provides a clear colour delineating contrast. I''d like to be here watching the ocean.', '2009-12-11 22:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764358, 837867, 22301, '<td valign="top">we need more entries like this!</td>', 'we need more entries like this!', '2009-12-11 22:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764364, 837781, 22301, '<td valign="top">yes!</td>', 'yes!', '2009-12-11 22:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764370, 838033, 23317, '<td valign="top">That dang parking sign detracts for me.  Other than that, this is one of my favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'That dang parking sign detracts for me.  Other than that, this is one of my favorites of the challenge.', '2009-12-11 22:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764372, 838490, 23317, '<td valign="top">There was some very good competition in this challenge and this was at the very top of my favorites list.  Well done.</td>', 'There was some very good competition in this challenge and this was at the very top of my favorites list.  Well done.', '2009-12-11 22:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764379, 837820, 53594, '<td valign="top">Beautiful in its simplicity.</td>', 'Beautiful in its simplicity.', '2009-12-11 23:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764382, 838157, 53594, '<td valign="top">Good focus and exposure control. Definitely in the top five.</td>', 'Good focus and exposure control. Definitely in the top five.', '2009-12-11 23:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764388, 838158, 53594, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite in this challenge. I like the colors, and the conveyance of movement through the unidirectional tilt of the Foxtails.</td>', 'One of my favorite in this challenge. I like the colors, and the conveyance of movement through the unidirectional tilt of the Foxtails.', '2009-12-11 23:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764393, 838490, 53594, '<td valign="top">I like the way the rays of light are emanating through the clouds. The boat in the lower right of the frame is a bit distracting but still in the top five in my opinion.</td>', 'I like the way the rays of light are emanating through the clouds. The boat in the lower right of the frame is a bit distracting but still in the top five in my opinion.', '2009-12-12 00:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764397, 838049, 53594, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. My eyes are drawn to the area of swirling water. The water''s movement is a welcome contrast to the lack of displayed on shore.</td>', 'I really like this photo. My eyes are drawn to the area of swirling water. The water''s movement is a welcome contrast to the lack of displayed on shore.', '2009-12-12 00:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764453, 838397, 96881, '<td valign="top">The mist coming off the waves is great, especially with the sun catching it.  The haze though does effect the overall effect, as it would have been great if the islands were significantly darker than they appear here.  Also, the crop to the left, cutting off the background, makes me wonder what is further around, and therefore gives the view a slight ''unfinished'' feel, as I dont think I have the full view.  The dark strip at the front as well does not add to the image.</td>', 'The mist coming off the waves is great, especially with the sun catching it.  The haze though does effect the overall effect, as it would have been great if the islands were significantly darker than they appear here.  Also, the crop to the left, cutting off the background, makes me wonder what is further around, and therefore gives the view a slight ''unfinished'' feel, as I dont think I have the full view.  The dark strip at the front as well does not add to the image.', '2009-12-12 04:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764454, 837508, 96881, '<td valign="top">A great Portrait of a mechanic, showing him in his surrounds.  You have managed, through great placement, to make him stand out and be the subject away from the clutter that is normal in a garage.  However, the use of excessive fill light in this image has removed any backlight or Contre-Jour feel of it.</td>', 'A great Portrait of a mechanic, showing him in his surrounds.  You have managed, through great placement, to make him stand out and be the subject away from the clutter that is normal in a garage.  However, the use of excessive fill light in this image has removed any backlight or Contre-Jour feel of it.', '2009-12-12 04:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764455, 837929, 96881, '<td valign="top">A great image for the Challenge.  You have really shown the traditional Contre-Jour feel.  The person is really well shown against the pain sky background, really highlighting him away from the water........</td>', 'A great image for the Challenge.  You have really shown the traditional Contre-Jour feel.  The person is really well shown against the pain sky background, really highlighting him away from the water........', '2009-12-12 04:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764456, 838471, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great image for the challenge.  A little bit more foreground to really finish off the image would have worked, making a full, black band across the bottom.  The sky here is great as the background to the subject, which has been highlighted really well.</td>', 'Great image for the challenge.  A little bit more foreground to really finish off the image would have worked, making a full, black band across the bottom.  The sky here is great as the background to the subject, which has been highlighted really well.', '2009-12-12 04:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764458, 838403, 96881, '<td valign="top">A good attempt for the challenge.  I am not a fan of the border.  The colour of it does not seem to match the photo.  For me, the border is too red.  A black border would have been better.  The power pole doesn''t add much to the image so cropping it out, and some sky would have emphasised the flag significantly......</td>', 'A good attempt for the challenge.  I am not a fan of the border.  The colour of it does not seem to match the photo.  For me, the border is too red.  A black border would have been better.  The power pole doesn''t add much to the image so cropping it out, and some sky would have emphasised the flag significantly......', '2009-12-12 04:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764459, 838075, 96881, '<td valign="top">A nice image for the challenge.  It would have been great if you moved around such that the light disc was directly behind the Temple, therefore having the glow on both sides....</td>', 'A nice image for the challenge.  It would have been great if you moved around such that the light disc was directly behind the Temple, therefore having the glow on both sides....', '2009-12-12 04:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764461, 837679, 96881, '<td valign="top">A really nice image of a man in his element, and a well constructed Contre-Jour photo.  You have retained the detail through the subject, while you have still kept the backlighting emphasis that is required.  The b&amp;w also really works for this subject.</td>', 'A really nice image of a man in his element, and a well constructed Contre-Jour photo.  You have retained the detail through the subject, while you have still kept the backlighting emphasis that is required.  The b&w also really works for this subject.', '2009-12-12 04:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764462, 838105, 96881, '<td valign="top">A brilliantly composed and executed Contre-Jour photo.  The backlight feel is very strong, while the details have been exceptionally well retained without destroying the backlight.  While other strong photos have gone for the Landscape, this portrait is exceptionally well done.  The border works well with this as well, as does the b&amp;w processing.</td>', 'A brilliantly composed and executed Contre-Jour photo.  The backlight feel is very strong, while the details have been exceptionally well retained without destroying the backlight.  While other strong photos have gone for the Landscape, this portrait is exceptionally well done.  The border works well with this as well, as does the b&w processing.', '2009-12-12 04:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764463, 838490, 96881, '<td valign="top">A really good photo for the challenge, with great colours through the sky and great retained detail in the foreground which really makes this image work.</td>', 'A really good photo for the challenge, with great colours through the sky and great retained detail in the foreground which really makes this image work.', '2009-12-12 04:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764466, 838462, 96881, '<td valign="top">Grea colour through the sky, and a great Contre-Jour image.  Maybe a less centred composition could have worked here, probably with the main trees to the right giving the negative sky space to the left........Apart from that, a really good submission</td>', 'Grea colour through the sky, and a great Contre-Jour image.  Maybe a less centred composition could have worked here, probably with the main trees to the right giving the negative sky space to the left........Apart from that, a really good submission', '2009-12-12 04:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764468, 838477, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great coloours through the sky in this image.  It is a shame that the dark clloud band at the lower part of the sky means the lower part of the tree starts to blend it.  If the lighter colour went all the way down to the hill, this would have gone from really good to brilliant.  Could a lower shooting perspective delivered this?   However, the rest of the image is very well done and a really good submission for the challenge</td>', 'Great coloours through the sky in this image.  It is a shame that the dark clloud band at the lower part of the sky means the lower part of the tree starts to blend it.  If the lighter colour went all the way down to the hill, this would have gone from really good to brilliant.  Could a lower shooting perspective delivered this?   However, the rest of the image is very well done and a really good submission for the challenge', '2009-12-12 04:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764469, 838230, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great colours through the sky.  the centred composition though makes this look a little more plain that it is.  A landscape crop, removing the large area of blue sky and therefore showing more colour and ofsetting the trees could have worked here.</td>', 'Great colours through the sky.  the centred composition though makes this look a little more plain that it is.  A landscape crop, removing the large area of blue sky and therefore showing more colour and ofsetting the trees could have worked here.', '2009-12-12 04:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764482, 838370, 77543, '<td valign="top">I''d have cropped to remove the sky at the top.</td>', 'I''d have cropped to remove the sky at the top.', '2009-12-12 05:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
