(5765256, 837964, 36981, '<td valign="top">Okay, I googled Steve Krug quickly but still don''t come close to getting it (I''m unwilling to read much about him, so I''m probably just missing something.)  I don''t know if this is creative spam, or a serious picture, so: I liked the image before I read the title; it actually was one of the stand-outs for me because it''s so different.  I''m not fond of the fairly static composition, but I liked the tones &amp; sense of mystery.  The title, however, seems to refer to a business-book, which kind of destroyed that sense of mystery and art for me.</td>', 'Okay, I googled Steve Krug quickly but still don''t come close to getting it (I''m unwilling to read much about him, so I''m probably just missing something.)  I don''t know if this is creative spam, or a serious picture, so: I liked the image before I read the title; it actually was one of the stand-outs for me because it''s so different.  I''m not fond of the fairly static composition, but I liked the tones & sense of mystery.  The title, however, seems to refer to a business-book, which kind of destroyed that sense of mystery and art for me.', '2009-12-13 09:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765257, 837534, 36981, '<td valign="top">Wow - in general, I hate pictures of chess sets, figurines, etc., but this is done so beautifully that I really like it.  The lighting is beautiful and somehow creates a sense of anticipation.</td>', 'Wow - in general, I hate pictures of chess sets, figurines, etc., but this is done so beautifully that I really like it.  The lighting is beautiful and somehow creates a sense of anticipation.', '2009-12-13 09:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
