(5765329, 838230, 30861, '<td valign="top">On my first pass through, I yawned at this one and gave it a 5; "another sunset silhouette, next please!"<br/> <br/>But upon review, I see a LOT more. I have NO idea how much of this you put in intentionally, and how much of it is just my "read", but it works:<br/> <br/>I see, on the left, a father lecturing a child, with upraised arm and pointing finger, hair electric with anger. I see in the center that child, hunched and cowering. I see on the right another child huddling in her mother''s embrace as they watch the father dressing down the middle child.<br/> <br/>I don''t mean any of this in a "domestic violence" way, I''m not getting negative vibes, I just see a prototypical family scene and I am much amused. Anthropomorphic as all get out. Well done. Bump to 8.</td>', 'On my first pass through, I yawned at this one and gave it a 5; "another sunset silhouette, next please!" But upon review, I see a LOT more. I have NO idea how much of this you put in intentionally, and how much of it is just my "read", but it works: I see, on the left, a father lecturing a child, with upraised arm and pointing finger, hair electric with anger. I see in the center that child, hunched and cowering. I see on the right another child huddling in her mother''s embrace as they watch the father dressing down the middle child. I don''t mean any of this in a "domestic violence" way, I''m not getting negative vibes, I just see a prototypical family scene and I am much amused. Anthropomorphic as all get out. Well done. Bump to 8.', '2009-12-13 11:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765396, 837854, 96881, '<td valign="top">A good attempt for the challenge here, but the overall image is too dark.  The large dark half of the image does not add to the photo, and the lack of any fill lighting meaning no detail in the cats also does not help the image.......</td>', 'A good attempt for the challenge here, but the overall image is too dark.  The large dark half of the image does not add to the photo, and the lack of any fill lighting meaning no detail in the cats also does not help the image.......', '2009-12-13 13:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765397, 838160, 96881, '<td valign="top">Shock value.......yes.  Composition though is not as good as it could be, and I think for this type of image to really work, all of the technicals have to be spot on, as other voters are going to vote it low on the subject..........</td>', 'Shock value.......yes.  Composition though is not as good as it could be, and I think for this type of image to really work, all of the technicals have to be spot on, as other voters are going to vote it low on the subject..........', '2009-12-13 13:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765398, 837682, 96881, '<td valign="top">The backlighting here does not seem to add to the photo, instead I feel it detracts from it.  It is way too overdone..........  The internal reflections from your lens also are a major detraction in the image, and the composition to me looks like a snapshot..........</td>', 'The backlighting here does not seem to add to the photo, instead I feel it detracts from it.  It is way too overdone..........  The internal reflections from your lens also are a major detraction in the image, and the composition to me looks like a snapshot..........', '2009-12-13 13:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
