(5765668, 838503, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good representation of contre-jour as the light source is clearly visible. There appears to be a severe tilt to the horizon that detracts. I think the different lighting available shows different degrees of warmth. The street light is a very blue light and really contrasts badly with the warm incandesent lighting on the houses. You did a great job of exposing the tree where the branches add some great texture to this photo.</td>', 'Good representation of contre-jour as the light source is clearly visible. There appears to be a severe tilt to the horizon that detracts. I think the different lighting available shows different degrees of warmth. The street light is a very blue light and really contrasts badly with the warm incandesent lighting on the houses. You did a great job of exposing the tree where the branches add some great texture to this photo.', '2009-12-13 18:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765680, 838400, 10785, '<td valign="top">You did a great job of controlling the natural light by shutting the curtain. There is some graininess to this photo that doesn''t do it any justice. Also the subject is somewhat dark and I would have liked to this photo exposed for the foreground, rather than the background. All in all this is a beautiful still life object that is composed very well in the frame.</td>', 'You did a great job of controlling the natural light by shutting the curtain. There is some graininess to this photo that doesn''t do it any justice. Also the subject is somewhat dark and I would have liked to this photo exposed for the foreground, rather than the background. All in all this is a beautiful still life object that is composed very well in the frame.', '2009-12-13 18:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765691, 837539, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... but you should turn that model around to add greater interest. A cool shot woould have been to shoot up at the model''s face with the spinning carousel in the top background and compose it portrait style.</td>', 'Nice shot... but you should turn that model around to add greater interest. A cool shot woould have been to shoot up at the model''s face with the spinning carousel in the top background and compose it portrait style.', '2009-12-13 18:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765876, 838503, 90414, '<td valign="top">I like the shadows, but you need to watch your horizons... DPC voters demand strong basics like fixing tilting horizons.</td>', 'I like the shadows, but you need to watch your horizons... DPC voters demand strong basics like fixing tilting horizons.', '2009-12-13 21:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765884, 838143, 88580, '<td valign="top">Not sure what I''m looking at, and I don''t care much for the aspect ratio, but I like the composition and all the interesting shapes and colors.  10</td>', 'Not sure what I''m looking at, and I don''t care much for the aspect ratio, but I like the composition and all the interesting shapes and colors.  10', '2009-12-13 21:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
