(5768928, 838050, 112658, '<td valign="top">Thank you to everyone for voting!!  This was indeed my first ever submission, beginners luck I''d guess.<br/> <br/>I stumbled upon this site after this shot was taken and flipped throught the challenges, remembered I had this particular shot and entered it.  Awesome... so awesome, I need to pay up and get the membership so I can join all of the challenges.  But I''m not sure I''ll be able to repeat a Blue Ribbon anytime soon.... then again beginners luck may last for a streak.<br/> <br/>But why would some people vote "1", and then no one vote "2"... just to see the score drop??  Lame, lame, lame.<br/> <br/>Thanks again for voting and for all of the commments.  I''ll be back with more!</td>', 'Thank you to everyone for voting!!  This was indeed my first ever submission, beginners luck I''d guess. I stumbled upon this site after this shot was taken and flipped throught the challenges, remembered I had this particular shot and entered it.  Awesome... so awesome, I need to pay up and get the membership so I can join all of the challenges.  But I''m not sure I''ll be able to repeat a Blue Ribbon anytime soon.... then again beginners luck may last for a streak. But why would some people vote "1", and then no one vote "2"... just to see the score drop??  Lame, lame, lame. Thanks again for voting and for all of the commments.  I''ll be back with more!', '2009-12-16 04:54:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5768931, 838050, 100773, '<td valign="top">That wasn''t an all to bad start on your DPC membership! Blue ribbon, 11 favorites, as well as your photo topped the "highest rated photograph" on both camera and lens. Stunning photo!<br/> <br/>ETA: Some votes low on purpose, I''m not sure why. There are hundreds of threads in the forum discussing low voters. Hopefully something can be done with it soon. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-12-16 04:59:57.</i></td>', 'That wasn''t an all to bad start on your DPC membership! Blue ribbon, 11 favorites, as well as your photo topped the "highest rated photograph" on both camera and lens. Stunning photo! ETA: Some votes low on purpose, I''m not sure why. There are hundreds of threads in the forum discussing low voters. Hopefully something can be done with it soon. ', '2009-12-16 04:57:35.000000', '2009-12-16 04:59:57.000000', 0),
