(5768989, 837935, 112013, '<td valign="top">Amazing. Out of 160+ entries? I literally jumped out of my car and snapped a few pictures on sports mode because I was losing the sun. I never used the sports mode before and held the camera at knee level not even looking at the LCD monitor. I didnt have much time and had to wait for the kids to do stuff with the bikes. I just pointed in the general direction and snapped.  After about 15 pictures my fingers began to freeze up so I went back to my car and hoped I got something good. I like it in black and white because it looked creepy and I loved the zombie comments! Ty everyone for all of your newbee support and Im very very happy! I love that it was chosen as a favorite! Snaffles is right. The bar is set high now. I just hope I do as good in other challenges.</td>', 'Amazing. Out of 160+ entries? I literally jumped out of my car and snapped a few pictures on sports mode because I was losing the sun. I never used the sports mode before and held the camera at knee level not even looking at the LCD monitor. I didnt have much time and had to wait for the kids to do stuff with the bikes. I just pointed in the general direction and snapped.  After about 15 pictures my fingers began to freeze up so I went back to my car and hoped I got something good. I like it in black and white because it looked creepy and I loved the zombie comments! Ty everyone for all of your newbee support and Im very very happy! I love that it was chosen as a favorite! Snaffles is right. The bar is set high now. I just hope I do as good in other challenges.', '2009-12-16 07:36:02.000000', NULL, 0),
