(5769283, 838050, 96751, '<td valign="top">You''re just hitting all the firsts of DPC with this one!  Ribbon winner, awesome score, and now (most likely) a DQ.  Welcome!!!</td>', 'You''re just hitting all the firsts of DPC with this one!  Ribbon winner, awesome score, and now (most likely) a DQ.  Welcome!!!', '2009-12-16 13:05:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5769321, 838050, 86447, '<td valign="top">Bummer about the DQ... It''s a stunning shot!</td>', 'Bummer about the DQ... It''s a stunning shot!', '2009-12-16 13:39:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5769324, 838510, 8050, '<td valign="top">The whole point is the subtlety between the silhouette of the tree and the sky.  Yes, it almost looks upside down, but I chose this image for that reason.  I feel as if most people on this site enjoy typical images and don''t like to step out of the box.</td>', 'The whole point is the subtlety between the silhouette of the tree and the sky.  Yes, it almost looks upside down, but I chose this image for that reason.  I feel as if most people on this site enjoy typical images and don''t like to step out of the box.', '2009-12-16 13:47:04.000000', NULL, 0),
