(5769477, 837754, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the lights - I love the way they reflect on the pavement when it rains - I need to get out and shoot that more often (''cept I don''t have any models to use.)  Top 20% is quite good, I''d say!  Got a good score from me.</td>', 'Nice use of the lights - I love the way they reflect on the pavement when it rains - I need to get out and shoot that more often (''cept I don''t have any models to use.)  Top 20% is quite good, I''d say!  Got a good score from me.', '2009-12-16 16:41:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5769510, 838490, 82707, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  Beautiful image!  I love the sunrays, and the colourful subtlety of the image.</td>', 'Congratulations!  Beautiful image!  I love the sunrays, and the colourful subtlety of the image.', '2009-12-16 17:27:29.000000', NULL, 0),
