(5769575, 838050, 50578, '<td valign="top">Hey Jac, Scroll down this thread about 8 or 9 posts and you will find the answer to your question.  <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jac:</b></div><hr/><i> Sucks big time but a fantastic photo all the same.<br/> <br/>Was it a daylight saving time thing? Your camera? </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Hey Jac, Scroll down this thread about 8 or 9 posts and you will find the answer to your question.   Originally posted by Jac: Sucks big time but a fantastic photo all the same. Was it a daylight saving time thing? Your camera? ', '2009-12-16 18:23:04.000000', NULL, 0),
