(5769645, 837935, 37845, '<td valign="top">Nice to seem some new talent here taking some ribbons. Congrats on the win, and hope to see a lot more from you.</td>', 'Nice to seem some new talent here taking some ribbons. Congrats on the win, and hope to see a lot more from you.', '2009-12-16 19:34:49.000000', NULL, 0),
