(5769721, 838369, 34876, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lutchenko:</b></div><hr/><i> hey top 10 now kris... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>YES!!!! I was so excited to see the results! Thanks for all that you did, if it weren''t for you I prob would have put another dud photo lol</td>', 'Originally posted by Lutchenko: hey top 10 now kris...   YES!!!! I was so excited to see the results! Thanks for all that you did, if it weren''t for you I prob would have put another dud photo lol', '2009-12-16 21:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5769723, 838369, 34876, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by romil:</b></div><hr/><i> This is brilliant!!!! should''ve made the first page! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I wish! 10th is great too :] new pb so I was stoked!<br/> <br/>Thanks!</td>', 'Originally posted by romil: This is brilliant!!!! should''ve made the first page!   I wish! 10th is great too :] new pb so I was stoked! Thanks!', '2009-12-16 21:09:07.000000', NULL, 0),
