(5769774, 837935, 112013, '<td valign="top">Wow. This was a weird surprise to come home to tonight. I feel bad for the other new person who lost their ribbon though. :(  Not sure anyone wants to get a first place this way so its bittersweet. <br/> <br/>ty you all again for the comments!</td>', 'Wow. This was a weird surprise to come home to tonight. I feel bad for the other new person who lost their ribbon though. :(  Not sure anyone wants to get a first place this way so its bittersweet.  ty you all again for the comments!', '2009-12-16 22:26:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5769783, 838050, 112013, '<td valign="top">This is horrible.  Im so sorry.  It is a fabulous picture though and you should be proud of it!</td>', 'This is horrible.  Im so sorry.  It is a fabulous picture though and you should be proud of it!', '2009-12-16 22:31:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5769791, 838201, 69046, '<td valign="top">I put this at a 9. Being a long time fan of your work I feel real joy in what you''ve accomplished here. I honestly feel this is your best yet, I thrill in your progress  :)</td>', 'I put this at a 9. Being a long time fan of your work I feel real joy in what you''ve accomplished here. I honestly feel this is your best yet, I thrill in your progress  :)', '2009-12-16 22:38:32.000000', NULL, 0),
