(5769988, 838050, 112658, '<td valign="top">As for my first entry ever on this website I should have read the rules more carefully before I submitted my image.<br/> <br/>Still thank you for all of the comments, and next challenge I will make sure to read everything before I submit.</td>', 'As for my first entry ever on this website I should have read the rules more carefully before I submitted my image. Still thank you for all of the comments, and next challenge I will make sure to read everything before I submit.', '2009-12-17 04:53:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5770032, 838157, 67363, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Judi on an awesome photo!!!</td>', 'Congratulations Judi on an awesome photo!!!', '2009-12-17 05:35:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5770062, 838259, 112107, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments.<br/>I guess that many times photography has a something to do with luck. I only saw the "eye" look after the photo was taken. By the size of the drop you can easily imagine how tiny and easy to miss the air bubbles were.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments.I guess that many times photography has a something to do with luck. I only saw the "eye" look after the photo was taken. By the size of the drop you can easily imagine how tiny and easy to miss the air bubbles were.', '2009-12-17 07:44:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5770141, 838050, 28564, '<td valign="top">it still remains a very very good photograph, the ribbon is subjected to DPC rules, but this not meant that the photograph is not good.... many many compliments.</td>', 'it still remains a very very good photograph, the ribbon is subjected to DPC rules, but this not meant that the photograph is not good.... many many compliments.', '2009-12-17 09:35:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5770144, 838050, 51538, '<td valign="top">Glad you''re going to eat the DQ with good grace.  Come back and share some more nice images like this and they''re sure to be appreciated.</td>', 'Glad you''re going to eat the DQ with good grace.  Come back and share some more nice images like this and they''re sure to be appreciated.', '2009-12-17 09:38:00.000000', NULL, 0),
