(5770500, 837864, 68504, '<td valign="top">Yes, the inky black is compelling and a great foil for the twinky lights and oily silver moon gleams and the very few (subtle!) tones in between.  Mt. Baker (?) taking a very stolid backseat.</td>', 'Yes, the inky black is compelling and a great foil for the twinky lights and oily silver moon gleams and the very few (subtle!) tones in between.  Mt. Baker (?) taking a very stolid backseat.', '2009-12-17 16:24:53.000000', NULL, 0),
