(5771740, 838378, 67152, '<td valign="top">i am a big fan of this as a concept - i just wonder if ''the prayer'' being slightly off center works against you a bit.  although, the rest of the image is so centered and maybe that helps me linger more...not sure still...</td>', 'i am a big fan of this as a concept - i just wonder if ''the prayer'' being slightly off center works against you a bit.  although, the rest of the image is so centered and maybe that helps me linger more...not sure still...', '2009-12-18 19:23:14.000000', NULL, 0),
