(5771918, 838050, 31664, '<td valign="top">Great shot for your first entry,  too bad about the DQ,  hope it doesn''t discourage you.</td>', 'Great shot for your first entry,  too bad about the DQ,  hope it doesn''t discourage you.', '2009-12-19 01:22:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5771956, 838050, 52750, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ChapmanStapleford:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/> <br/>But why would some people vote "1", and then no one vote "2"... just to see the score drop??  Lame, lame, lame.<br/> <br/> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Don''t put too much stock in the stray low scores. When my brother was showing my mom one of his entries which was still in voting stage (not on this challenge), I noticed she kept hitting "1"... she thought she was clicking on the right link to get back to the "first page". <br/> <br/>The colors are a bit too saturated for my tastes, but that seems to be the norm for a lot of the winning/high rated images here. A perfect crop on this one for me would have been just above the horizon. Just my opinion. Congrats on achieving the winning vote, even if it was short lived. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by ChapmanStapleford:  But why would some people vote "1", and then no one vote "2"... just to see the score drop??  Lame, lame, lame.    Don''t put too much stock in the stray low scores. When my brother was showing my mom one of his entries which was still in voting stage (not on this challenge), I noticed she kept hitting "1"... she thought she was clicking on the right link to get back to the "first page".  The colors are a bit too saturated for my tastes, but that seems to be the norm for a lot of the winning/high rated images here. A perfect crop on this one for me would have been just above the horizon. Just my opinion. Congrats on achieving the winning vote, even if it was short lived. :)', '2009-12-19 04:08:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5772624, 837935, 107027, '<td valign="top">this is an awesome picture, I love everything about it.  I keep hearing good things about the camera you used too!  I showed your photo to my sister, who''s looking for a new camera, as evidence as to the amazing capabilities of this camera (in the right hands like yours of course!)<br/> <br/>Looking forward to seeing more of your shots...congrats on the blue ribbon!<br/> <br/>Joe</td>', 'this is an awesome picture, I love everything about it.  I keep hearing good things about the camera you used too!  I showed your photo to my sister, who''s looking for a new camera, as evidence as to the amazing capabilities of this camera (in the right hands like yours of course!) Looking forward to seeing more of your shots...congrats on the blue ribbon! Joe', '2009-12-19 20:34:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5772771, 838259, 111625, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, one of my favorites from the challenge</td>', 'This is a great shot, one of my favorites from the challenge', '2009-12-19 22:55:47.000000', NULL, 0),
