(5772942, 838050, 67237, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic image. Too bad about the date.<br/>I just wonder why you entered the date the pic was taken as "Dec 4, 2009"  at the time of submission on Dec 7,2009?.</td>', 'This is a fantastic image. Too bad about the date.I just wonder why you entered the date the pic was taken as "Dec 4, 2009"  at the time of submission on Dec 7,2009?.', '2009-12-20 03:03:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5773315, 837864, 19936, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tnun:</b></div><hr/><i> Yes, the inky black is compelling and a great foil for the twinky lights and oily silver moon gleams and the very few (subtle!) tones in between.  Mt. Baker (?) taking a very stolid backseat. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the comment and yes that is Mt. Baker from Cap Sante in Anacortes.</td>', 'Originally posted by tnun: Yes, the inky black is compelling and a great foil for the twinky lights and oily silver moon gleams and the very few (subtle!) tones in between.  Mt. Baker (?) taking a very stolid backseat.   Thanks for the comment and yes that is Mt. Baker from Cap Sante in Anacortes.', '2009-12-20 15:49:24.000000', NULL, 0),
